ungroupGraphic [SimTalk]
Ungroups the designated group of graphics of the graphic designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Assigning the method deactivates graphic inheritance.
You cannot assign the method if the graphic is an automatically generated graphic group or if the graphic
is located in an automatically generated graphic group.
Syntax
<Path>.ungroupGraphic
Type
Method
Examples
MyFrame._3D.getGraphic("default", [1,2,3]).ungroupGraphic
MyFrame._3D.getGraphic("deco", [1,2,3]).ungroupGraphic
See also
Ungroup Group of Graphics
groupGraphics [SimTalk]
_3D.getGraphic [SimTalk]
