_3D.ExternalGraphicGroups [SimTalk]
Sets the list of all external graphic groups of the Frame designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Visible external graphic groups are shown in 3D windows that opened a Frame which contains the
designated Frame that owns these graphic groups.
Note
Assigning the attribute deactivates graphic inheritance of the Frame designated by <Path>.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.ExternalGraphicGroups:string[]
Assignment Value
You can assign an array of data type string.
Example
.Models.Model._3D.ExternalGraphicGroups := ["default", “alternative"]
var a : string[] := .Models.Model._3D.ExternalGraphicGroups
