_3D.LockedGraphicGroups [SimTalk]
Sets the list of all locked graphic groups of the object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Locking graphic groups prevents you from selecting this graphic group in the 3D windows which are
opened for this object. This makes, for example, sense for the graphic of a factory building which might
otherwise be selected inadvertently.
Note
Assigning the attribute deactivates graphic inheritance.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>._3D.LockedGraphicGroups:string[]
Assignment Value
You can assign an array of data type string.
Example
.Models.Model.Station1._3D.LockedGraphicGroups := ["Group1, Group2"]
var a: string[] := .Models.Model.Station1._3D.LockedGraphicGroups
See also
Edit 3D Properties [dialog] > Graphics [tab] >
Locked [graphic group]
_3D.InternalGraphicGroups [SimTalk]
